Health and Safety Management

TVNL is of the firm belief that the health and safety of the employees is of paramount importance. TVNL is committed to identify and assess all types of occupational health and safety risk and takes proactive steps to reduce the significant risk in turn to reduce the occurrences of accidents. The measures taken are listed under:

Power station is equipped with dispensaries with qualified doctors have all primary facilities;

All the major locations in power station are equipped with primary aid box and Provision of round the clock ambulance is made in the power station;

All employees are issued with personal protective safety equipment and Safety officers are posted at power station to take care of safe working practices;

Efforts are being made to create awareness of occupationally health and safety in all employees, contractors and contract labour and training them adequately for safe working practices.
